# Pairs with ListedRestorable. Half of production before the fix of #5637: a
# catalog rebuild registered any sink manifest it found. An operator delete
# whose caller was lost after deleting artifacts leaves its manifest behind;
# once its lease runs out a rebuild lists a backup that cannot be restored.
MODULE: ListedRestorableRebuildUnprobed
TARGET: ListedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a rebuild re-lists a sink manifest without probing its artifacts
PERTURBS: Rebuild

--- FIND
    /\ man = "A"
    /\ art
    /\ row' = "A"
--- REPLACE
    /\ man = "A"
    \* MUTATION: no artifact probe.
    /\ row' = "A"
--- END
